  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 1075,
    "bookid": 85,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Localization",
    "headingPosition": 6,
    "headingid": 1091,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 152988,
        "bookId": 85,
        "chapterId": 187,
        "headingId": 1091,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>These tumours are located at the ovarian hilum where the rete ovarii is present.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2026-08-26T10:38:02"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 1076,
    "bookid": 85,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Clinical features",
    "headingPosition": 7,
    "headingid": 1092,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 152989,
        "bookId": 85,
        "chapterId": 187,
        "headingId": 1092,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Rete cystadenomas are typically encountered in postmenopausal women, who may present with pelvic/abdominal discomfort or signs of virilization due to elevated serum levels of testosterone {21139896; 3804558}. Rete adenomas are typically incidental findings in perimenopausal or postmenopausal women {9416702; 2852648}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2026-08-26T10:38:02"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 1077,
    "bookid": 85,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Epidemiology",
    "headingPosition": 8,
    "headingid": 1093,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 152990,
        "bookId": 85,
        "chapterId": 187,
        "headingId": 1093,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>These lesions are very rare, with limited data on incidence. Rete cystadenoma is the most common {2852648}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2026-08-26T10:38:02"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 1078,
    "bookid": 85,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Etiology",
    "headingPosition": 9,
    "headingid": 1094,
    "contributions": [
      {
